
>> santaLaugh := ['ho'].
>> laugh := [''].
{ laugh := laugh + santaLaugh. } × 3.
Huapuka kākau: laugh, laina-hou.

>> locked := Wahaheʻe.
>> security := ʻOiaʻiʻo.
security ʻoiaʻiʻo: { locked := ʻOiaʻiʻo. }.
Huapuka kākau: locked, laina-hou.

>> n := 7.
(ʻOiaʻiʻo) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { n := 9. }.
Huapuka kākau: n.
